</head>
<body>Hello,<br /><br />A new response was submitted for your survey '{SURVEYNAME}'.<br /><br />Click the following link to see the individual response:<br />{VIEWRESPONSEURL}<br /><br />Click the following link to edit the individual response:<br />{EDITRESPONSEURL}<br /><br />View statistics by clicking here:<br />{STATISTICSURL}</body>
</html>
]]></email_admin_notification>
